<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Your Kade-AI account is ready</title></head>
<body style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:#202020;max-width:600px;margin:24px auto;padding:16px">
<h1>Your Kade-AI account is ready</h1>
<p>Hi {{name}},</p>
<p>Kade approved your access. You can sign in at <a href="{{domain}}">Kade-AI</a>.</p>
<p>Sign-in: <strong>{{loginId}}</strong></p>
{{#if password}}
<p>Temporary password: <strong>{{password}}</strong></p>
<p>After signing in, change your temporary password in Settings, then Account.</p>
{{else}}
<p>Your existing password still works. It has not been changed.</p>
{{#if resetEnabled}}<p>If you have forgotten it, choose Forgot password on the sign-in page.</p>{{/if}}
{{/if}}
<p>If you need help, reply to this email and Kade can help you.</p>
<p>Welcome!<br>Kade-AI</p>
</body></html>
